From c2ac762f3529d3e3888d2b6aaa0f85c1be5340af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:49:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qb64pe: drop the stray " 2.txt" duplicates in internal/source

The 3.4.0 tarball shipped sixteen Finder/Explorer "copy 2" files whose names
contain a space. The Makefile makes qbx.o depend on
$(wildcard internal/temp/*.txt), and after those files are copied into
internal/temp the wildcard splits "data10 2.txt" into two words, so make
reports "No rule to make target 'internal/temp/data10'". All sixteen are
byte-identical to their originals and nothing references them.
